WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,320
If you lose the black hardness, just lose it.

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:03,200
Anyway, it was the magic power that died.

3
00:00:03,200 --> 00:00:04,760
But the rejuvenating Han Dynasty will not die

4
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:07,520
My aunt can make herself so angry that she will be humiliated in this life

5
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:08,840
What a hatred

6
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,160
Just broke up

7
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:13,720
Who hasn’t had a few ex-boyfriends and broken up with them?

8
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:18,150
In my book, only the mourning king has not broken up

9
00:00:18,150 --> 00:00:19,670
This bastard broke up with me

10
00:00:19,670 --> 00:00:20,670
Lie to me and say he loves me too much

11
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:21,710
So a second personality was split

12
00:00:21,710 --> 00:00:22,870
And his second personality is me

13
00:00:22,870 --> 00:00:24,470
This way you can never be separated from me

14
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:26,870
Wait until I return to the Demon Palace with joy and wait for him to marry me

15
00:00:26,870 --> 00:00:27,790
As a result, he told me

16
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:29,270
He married the second personality in him

17
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:30,230
I'm not cheating

18
00:00:30,270 --> 00:00:32,270
I thought about it for fifty years before I figured it out

19
00:00:32,270 --> 00:00:42,460
This old bastard would rather solve it on his own than marry me and I have to watch my thumb.
